<table border="0" cellpadding="5" width="550" cellspacing="5" height="400" >
<tr valign="top" height="400" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p style="text-align: center;"><font size="2"><img src="https://qantas--c.ap1.content.force.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=0159000000FSVkd&amp;oid=00D900000010OOK&amp;lastMod=1521233610000" alt="Logo"></font></p><font size="2"><br><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">Ref No: {!Case.CaseNumber}</font></p><font size="2"><br><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">Dear {!Case.First_Name__c},</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">Thank you for contacting us about your disrupted journey from {!Case.Departure_Airport__c} on {!Case.TECH_Email_Departure_Date_Time__c}.</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">While safety must always be our first priority, I certainly appreciate how inconvenient the delay was for you, and would like to apologise for the impact this had on your planned itinerary after your arrival in to {!Case.Arrival_Airport__c}.</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">When a flight is delayed we take all available measures to minimise the disruption and our operations team will always rebook any onward connections on your ticket. I have checked your booking and can see that your flight to {!Case.Arrival_Airport__c}&nbsp;was on a separate ticket, so <b><i>-the rebooking fees/the cost of your new flight- </i></b>is not something that Qantas can assist with.</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">You will need to speak to your travel insurance provider regarding any out of pocket expenses arising from the delay, and we can provide any additional information your insurer requires, for you to make a claim through your policy. Please let me know if you require a letter, as I would be happy to provide this for you.</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><b><i><font size="2">-If High Tier add:-</font></i></b></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">As a gesture of goodwill, I have credited {!Case.Recovery_Quantity__c}&nbsp;Qantas Points to your Frequent Flyer account. You can use the points towards flights, the purchase of food and wine through Qantas Wine, or a range of products from our online Qantas Store.</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">I can assure you that we are committed to improving our delay handling processes when unforeseen issues occur, and first-hand experience like this is vital to developing our service. We are grateful you took the time to let us know what happened.</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">We are putting every effort into minimising delays and I hope you’ll see the difference the next time you travel.</font></p><font size="2"><br><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">Kind regards</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">{!User.FirstName}</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">Qantas Customer Care</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2"><img src="https://qantas--c.ap1.content.force.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=0159000000FSVke&amp;oid=00D900000010OOK&amp;lastMod=1521233610000" alt="Qantas_Logo"></font></p><font size="2"><br><br></font><p style=""></p><p style="text-align: center;"><span style="color: black; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"><font size="2">{!Case.Thread_Token}</font></span></p><p style="text-align: center;"><font size="2">Qantas Airways Limited, ABN 16 009 661 901</font></p><p style="text-align: center;"><font size="2">10 Bourke Road Mascot NSW 2020 Australia</font></p><p style="text-align: center;"><br></p><p style="font-size: 12pt; text-align: center;"><span style="text-align: left; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">***************************** PLEASE CONSIDER OUR ENVIRONMENT BEFORE PRINTING *****************************&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p style="text-align: center;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" size="1" style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="text-align: left;">*********************************************** Confidentiality and Privilege Notice **********************************************&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></font></p><p><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">This e-mail is intended only to be read or used by the addressee. It is confidential and may contain legally privileged information. If you are not the addressee indicated in this message (or responsible for delivery of the message to such person), you may not copy or deliver this message to anyone, and you should destroy this message and kindly notify the sender by reply e-mail. Confidentiality and legal privilege are not waived or lost by</span><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">&nbsp;</span><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">reason of mistaken delivery to you. Qantas Airways Limited ABN 16 009 661 901&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">***************************************************************************************************************************************</span></p>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>